// Translate in place: replace the //RS lines below with the 1:1 Jet port (keep `// Rust: <file>:<line>` anchors).
//RS //! Nix-style package store (M12.1, D-PM1/5).
//RS //!
//RS //! Store layout: `~/.jet/store/<name>-<version>-<fingerprint>/`
//RS //! Full plan fingerprint is the path suffix. Lookups use the lockfile,
//RS //! not dirname parsing. Hardlinks into project `.jet/build/deps/`
//RS //! on same device; falls back to copy cross-device. Append-only; `jet clean`
//RS //! removes unreferenced entries (stub in M12.1).
//RS 
